        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b0b143e3-0b58-5126-86a3-dd005fc9c151",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jorge Salán, Jeff Scott Soto, Robin Beck, Fiona Flanagan, Bob Daisley\n- Organizations: Jeff Scott Soto Band, SOTO, Journey\n- Roles: lead guitar, singer, bass guitar player\n- Events: Robin Beck's European Tour 2013\n\nFacts:\n- Robin Beck was born on November 7, 1954 in Brooklyn, New York.\n- Robin Beck is an American singer.\n- From 2009 to the present, Jorge Salán has been the lead guitarist for solo singer Jeff Scott Soto and for the Jeff Scott Soto Band, now called SOTO.\n- Jeff Scott Soto was a leading voice of Journey and worked with Yngwie Malmsteen.\n- In 2013, Jorge Salán was the lead guitarist on Robin Beck's European Tour.\n- Jorge Salán is known for collaborating with rock musicians including Fiona Flanagan and bass guitar player Bob Daisley.",
